{"html_text": {"ja405:0.1": "<article id='ja405'><header><ul><li class='division'>{}</li>", "ja405:0.2": "<li>{}</li>", "ja405:0.3": "<li>{}</li></ul>", "ja405:0.4": "<h1 class='sutta-title'>{}</h1></header>", "ja405:1.1": "<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja405:1.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja405:1.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja405:1.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja405:2.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja405:2.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja405:2.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja405:2.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja405:3.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja405:3.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja405:3.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja405:3.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja405:4.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja405:4.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja405:4.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja405:4.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja405:5.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja405:5.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja405:5.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja405:5.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja405:6.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja405:6.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja405:6.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja405:6.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja405:6.5": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja405:7.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja405:7.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja405:7.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja405:7.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja405:8.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja405:8.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja405:8.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja405:8.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p></blockquote>", "ja405:9.1": "<p class='endsutta'>{}</p>", "ja405:9.2": "<p class='endvagga'>{}</p>", "ja405:10.1": "<p class='uddana-intro'>{}</p>", "ja405:11.1": "<blockquote class='uddanagatha'><p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja405:11.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja405:11.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja405:11.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p></blockquote></article>"}, "root_text": {"ja405:0.1": "Jātaka ", "ja405:0.2": "Sattakanipāta ", "ja405:0.3": "Kukkuvagga ", "ja405:0.4": "10. Bakajātaka ", "ja405:1.1": "“Dvāsattati gotama puññakammā, ", "ja405:1.2": "Vasavattino jātijaraṁ atītā; ", "ja405:1.3": "Ayamantimā vedagū brahmapatti, ", "ja405:1.4": "Asmābhijappanti janā anekā”. ", "ja405:2.1": "“Appañhi etaṁ na hi dīghamāyu, ", "ja405:2.2": "Yaṁ tvaṁ baka maññasi dīghamāyuṁ; ", "ja405:2.3": "Sataṁ sahassāni nirabbudānaṁ, ", "ja405:2.4": "Āyuṁ pajānāmi tavāha brahme”. ", "ja405:3.1": "“Anantadassī bhagavāhamasmi, ", "ja405:3.2": "Jātijjaraṁ sokamupātivatto; ", "ja405:3.3": "Kiṁ me purāṇaṁ vatasīlavattaṁ, ", "ja405:3.4": "Ācikkha me taṁ yamahaṁ vijaññaṁ”. ", "ja405:4.1": "“Yaṁ tvaṁ apāyesi bahū manusse, ", "ja405:4.2": "Pipāsite ghammani samparete; ", "ja405:4.3": "Taṁ te purāṇaṁ vatasīlavattaṁ, ", "ja405:4.4": "Suttappabuddhova anussarāmi. ", "ja405:5.1": "Yaṁ eṇikūlasmi janaṁ gahītaṁ, ", "ja405:5.2": "Amocayī gayhaka niyyamānaṁ; ", "ja405:5.3": "Taṁ te purāṇaṁ vatasīlavattaṁ, ", "ja405:5.4": "Suttappabuddhova anussarāmi. ", "ja405:6.1": "Gaṅgāya sotasmiṁ gahītanāvaṁ, ", "ja405:6.2": "Luddena nāgena manussakappā; ", "ja405:6.3": "Amocayi tvaṁ balasā pasayha, ", "ja405:6.4": "Taṁ te purāṇaṁ vatasīlavattaṁ; ", "ja405:6.5": "Suttappabuddhova anussarāmi. ", "ja405:7.1": "Kappo ca te baddhacaro ahosiṁ, ", "ja405:7.2": "Sambuddhimantaṁ vatinaṁ amaññaṁ; ", "ja405:7.3": "Taṁ te purāṇaṁ vatasīlavattaṁ, ", "ja405:7.4": "Suttappabuddhova anussarāmi”. ", "ja405:8.1": "“Addhā pajānāsi mametamāyuṁ, ", "ja405:8.2": "Aññampi jānāsi tathā hi buddho; ", "ja405:8.3": "Tathā hi tāyaṁ jalitānubhāvo, ", "ja405:8.4": "Obhāsayaṁ tiṭṭhati brahmalokan”ti. ", "ja405:9.1": "Bakajātakaṁ dasamaṁ. ", "ja405:9.2": "Kukkuvaggo paṭhamo. ", "ja405:10.1": "Tassuddānaṁ ", "ja405:11.1": "Varakaṇṇika cāpavaro sutano, ", "ja405:11.2": "Atha gijjha sarohitamacchavaro; ", "ja405:11.3": "Puna paṇṇaka senaka yācanako, ", "ja405:11.4": "Atha veri sabrahmabakena dasāti. "}, "variant_text": {"ja405:0.1": "", "ja405:0.2": "", "ja405:0.3": "", "ja405:0.4": "", "ja405:1.1": "gotama → bho gotama (mr) ", "ja405:1.2": "", "ja405:1.3": "brahmapatti → brahmupapatti (sya1ed, sya2ed, mr) ", "ja405:1.4": "janā → pajā (mr) ", "ja405:2.1": "Appañhi etaṁ → appañca hetaṁ (sya1ed, sya2ed); appaṁsi etaṁ (mr) ", "ja405:2.2": "", "ja405:2.3": "sahassāni → sahassānaṁ (bj, pts-vp-pli1 sn6.4:1 [4. Bakabrahmasutta]); sahassāna (sya1ed, sya2ed, km) ", "ja405:2.4": "", "ja405:3.1": "", "ja405:3.2": "", "ja405:3.3": "vatasīlavattaṁ → vatasīlavantaṁ (bj, pts-vp-pli1, mr) ", "ja405:3.4": "", "ja405:4.1": "", "ja405:4.2": "", "ja405:4.3": "", "ja405:4.4": "", "ja405:5.1": "", "ja405:5.2": "", "ja405:5.3": "", "ja405:5.4": "", "ja405:6.1": "", "ja405:6.2": "", "ja405:6.3": "", "ja405:6.4": "", "ja405:6.5": "", "ja405:7.1": "baddhacaro → patthacaro (sya1ed, sya2ed); paṭṭhacaro (mr) ", "ja405:7.2": "Sambuddhimantaṁ → sambuddhivantaṁ (sya1ed, sya2ed, pts-vp-pli1); sambuddhavantaṁ (mr) | vatinaṁ → vati taṁ (sya1ed); vatitaṁ (sya2ed); vatidaṁ (mr) ", "ja405:7.3": "", "ja405:7.4": "", "ja405:8.1": "", "ja405:8.2": "", "ja405:8.3": "tāyaṁ → tyāyaṁ (sn6.4:1 [4. Bakabrahmasutta]) ", "ja405:8.4": "", "ja405:9.1": "Bakajātakaṁ → bakabrahmajātakaṁ (bj, sya1ed, sya2ed, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja405:9.2": "", "ja405:10.1": "", "ja405:11.1": "", "ja405:11.2": "", "ja405:11.3": "paṇṇaka → dasaṇṇaka (sya1ed, sya2ed, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja405:11.4": ""}, "reference_text": {"ja405:0.1": "", "ja405:0.2": "", "ja405:0.3": "", "ja405:0.4": "", "ja405:1.1": "ms22J_1561, msdiv68, pts-vp-pli3.359, sya27.222, vri68.135